WEBVTT

00:05.840 --> 00:07.650
Where am I?

00:09.160 --> 00:10.700
And what's with this dress?

00:10.700 --> 00:12.120
Lady Balirossa.

00:12.120 --> 00:15.160
Congratulations on your marriage!

00:15.570 --> 00:17.910
Aren't you the Dark Army's...

00:18.310 --> 00:21.210
Balirossa, you're so beautiful.

00:23.130 --> 00:25.170
D-D-Dark One?!

00:25.170 --> 00:26.460
You can call me Ghozal.

00:26.460 --> 00:30.430
You're going to be my wife
from today, after all.

00:32.300 --> 00:34.350
As a wedding gift,

00:34.350 --> 00:38.350
we'll conquer this world with
our Dark Army's full might

00:38.350 --> 00:41.560
and present it to both of you!

00:41.560 --> 00:43.440
A wedding...?

00:43.440 --> 00:45.900
Long live, the Dark One!

00:45.900 --> 00:48.700
Long live, Lady Balirossa!

00:48.700 --> 00:50.280
Balirossa.

00:50.280 --> 00:54.660
I'm going to tribute this world
to your beauty.

00:56.620 --> 00:59.040
Wait! Wait! Wait!

00:59.040 --> 01:02.080
I don't need the world!

01:02.750 --> 01:05.420
I love you, Balirossa.

01:16.640 --> 01:20.100
A dream? Thank goodness...

01:20.560 --> 01:22.850
But why was I having that dream?!

01:22.850 --> 01:26.290
I don't even want to
remember the Dark One!

01:29.490 --> 01:32.990
You're noisy, Balirossa.

01:45.670 --> 01:57.430
CHILLIN' IN ANOTHER WORLD
WITH LV2 SUPER CHEAT POWERS

03:02.950 --> 03:06.500
#8 INVISIBLE WALL

03:10.670 --> 03:12.920
You baked it well.

03:12.920 --> 03:14.300
Y-Yes.

03:14.300 --> 03:17.140
But you don't look so well.

03:17.140 --> 03:19.550
It's just a little sleep-deprived.

03:19.550 --> 03:21.390
I've been having nightmares lately.

03:21.850 --> 03:23.470
Could it be...

03:23.870 --> 03:26.770
You're in love, aren't you?

03:26.770 --> 03:27.310
Huh?!

03:27.310 --> 03:30.520
For lupines, dreams are their own desires!

03:30.520 --> 03:36.150
It's said the person you love will appear
in your dreams and you'll get nightmares!

03:36.150 --> 03:38.410
I-I'm in love?!

03:38.410 --> 03:40.240
There's no way it can be true!

03:40.240 --> 03:42.080
You're in love? Really?

03:42.080 --> 03:43.910
Who is it?!

03:43.910 --> 03:45.330
Could it be...

03:45.330 --> 03:47.000
The Dark One?

03:48.130 --> 03:53.000
The Dark One used to come here
all the time to see Balirossa.

03:53.000 --> 03:54.260
Yeah.

03:54.260 --> 03:57.880
He was only coming to see Sir Flio.

03:57.880 --> 03:59.890
There's no way he's coming to see me.

03:59.890 --> 04:03.760
Whenever Balirossa wasn't around,
he always went back early.

04:03.760 --> 04:06.560
It was very obvious, wasn't it?

04:06.560 --> 04:07.730
Yeah.

04:07.730 --> 04:09.070
You're wrong!

04:09.070 --> 04:12.020
He was just taking advantage that
I was pointing my sword at him,

04:12.020 --> 04:14.940
and he was trying to kill me
whenever he could!

04:14.940 --> 04:18.400
It didn't look that way to me, though.

04:19.070 --> 04:22.740
Maybe Balirossa could win
the Dark One's heart?

04:22.740 --> 04:28.330
You might be able to cross the race barrier
and get along like Sir Flio and Lady Rys.

04:28.330 --> 04:33.540
We don't just get along.
We're in love.

04:33.870 --> 04:40.640
Come to think of it, we never heard
the story of how you two fell in love.

04:40.640 --> 04:43.680
I'm interested in that too.

04:43.680 --> 04:47.390
What made you attracted
to the Exalted One?

04:47.790 --> 04:49.310
If you ask about that...

04:49.310 --> 04:56.110
You already know how wonderful he is,
and I've never given much thought to it.

04:56.440 --> 04:59.320
But, well...

04:59.320 --> 05:03.160
If I had to give a reason,
I think it's because he's too naive.

05:03.160 --> 05:04.030
Oh?

05:04.030 --> 05:07.080
Lupines like to choose their mates
through combat.

05:07.080 --> 05:10.460
If anyone shows an opening,
it's the end of them.

05:10.460 --> 05:13.500
And he is full of that.

05:14.130 --> 05:18.090
At first, I thought I'd got
to do something about that.

05:18.090 --> 05:21.550
But then...

05:21.550 --> 05:22.680
Yes?

05:25.560 --> 05:30.230
I figured if we could be soft together,
that wouldn't be so bad.

05:32.600 --> 05:34.560
Soft?

05:34.560 --> 05:36.370
U-Um...

05:37.650 --> 05:42.740
Oh my, I just wanted to tell everyone
about my love for you!

05:47.410 --> 05:52.500
I've put up a barrier around the town
to keep demons or magic beasts away.

05:52.500 --> 05:53.790
Now we've got a reaction.

05:53.790 --> 05:57.460
It seems so.
I can sense the power of the demons.

05:57.460 --> 05:58.460
Demons?!

05:58.890 --> 06:00.420
Is the town in danger?

06:00.840 --> 06:04.510
It seems they haven't broken
through the barrier.

06:05.180 --> 06:08.760
I think it's better to keep an eye
on the town for a while.

06:19.400 --> 06:20.570
It can't be!

06:20.570 --> 06:22.490
Are you certain of that?

06:22.490 --> 06:23.150
Yes.

06:23.620 --> 06:28.030
The gold coins donated
by Sir Flio the other day

06:28.030 --> 06:33.330
were mostly Rode gold coins,
issued by the castle.

06:33.790 --> 06:38.000
I apologize for not meeting
your expectations, Princess.

06:38.000 --> 06:42.630
But I don't want to fight with either
the humans or the demons.

06:43.420 --> 06:47.090
Please use this for the
reconstruction of the town.

06:48.510 --> 06:53.480
Rode gold coins should not have been
distributed to the public. But how?

06:53.480 --> 06:57.020
There was someone
that we gave these gold coins to.

06:57.020 --> 06:57.860
Who was it?

06:58.210 --> 07:04.200
It was Banaza, the young man who was
summoned here due to our mistake.

07:04.630 --> 07:07.950
That young man who was banished
to the Delaveza Forest?

07:07.950 --> 07:08.910
Don't tell me...

07:09.240 --> 07:14.000
Perhaps he and Sir Flio
are the same person.

07:14.500 --> 07:16.670
I can't believe it.

07:16.670 --> 07:20.770
Of course, there's no way he would
accept the position of hero.

07:21.340 --> 07:23.510
What shall we do?

07:24.220 --> 07:25.680
If that's the case,

07:26.070 --> 07:30.640
we must start by apologizing to Sir Flio
and asking for his forgiveness.

07:30.640 --> 07:32.140
First Princess!

07:32.140 --> 07:33.680
What is it now?

07:33.680 --> 07:35.100
T-That's...

07:35.730 --> 07:40.770
The former hero and his servant have
escaped and fled from the castle!

07:40.770 --> 07:42.020
What?

07:42.020 --> 07:43.530
We're sorry!

07:43.530 --> 07:46.740
No. This is not your fault.

07:46.740 --> 07:51.280
Please enlist the help of local vigilantes
and adventurers to search for them.

07:51.280 --> 07:51.870
Yes!

07:53.160 --> 07:56.870
If only Sir Flio had been appointed
as the hero from the beginning...

07:58.080 --> 08:01.630
No, it's too late to say such things now.

08:01.630 --> 08:06.950
Since I was also the one who appointed
that Golden-Haired Hero...

08:09.180 --> 08:11.050
It's useless.
I can't find him!

08:11.050 --> 08:12.930
They shouldn't have gone that far.

08:12.930 --> 08:16.910
Captain! There is a path out through
the forest over there!

08:17.640 --> 08:19.940
Looks like we finally lost them.

08:20.690 --> 08:25.570
We've been running nonstop
since we got out of the prison.

08:25.570 --> 08:28.700
I'm really tired, Sir Hero.

08:28.700 --> 08:31.280
Blame that worthless djinn!

08:31.280 --> 08:34.410
She made me look like a criminal!

08:34.800 --> 08:39.210
But we're fugitives and burglars now.

08:39.210 --> 08:41.210
Don't be ridiculous.

08:41.210 --> 08:43.920
We escaped from jail,
but we didn't steal anything.

08:43.920 --> 08:45.380
You did, though.

08:45.380 --> 08:46.730
When we escaped,

08:46.730 --> 08:51.300
you took the bottomless bag
in desperation, didn't you?

08:51.680 --> 08:53.430
I didn't steal this.

08:53.430 --> 08:57.020
I took it in exchange for
the promised reward.

08:57.020 --> 08:59.520
Reward?

08:59.880 --> 09:00.690
That's right.

09:00.690 --> 09:03.940
Once done with the hero duty,

09:03.940 --> 09:09.110
I was promised a pile of gold worth
20 people and a comfortable life.

09:09.110 --> 09:15.200
They should thank me
since I only took one bottomless bag.

09:15.200 --> 09:18.500
But that was all you could grab
while we escaped.

09:18.500 --> 09:22.210
Right, I haven't checked the content yet.

09:22.210 --> 09:25.340
Damn it! No gold in it!

09:25.340 --> 09:29.670
Instead, we've got one perpetual
water bag and a treasure chest.

09:32.490 --> 09:36.350
If we sell what's in there, it could
be able to fund our runaway life.

09:37.470 --> 09:39.600
W-What the heck is this?!

09:40.140 --> 09:43.120
Drilldozer Shovel?

09:43.560 --> 09:45.020
I heard the voices!

09:45.020 --> 09:46.110
Over here!

09:48.230 --> 09:50.400
I believe it was from here.

09:51.320 --> 09:52.320
Let's go.

09:56.990 --> 09:59.620
That's amazing, Sir Hero.

09:59.620 --> 10:02.670
That shovel made a hole
like this in an instant.

10:02.670 --> 10:05.750
Hmm, even if it's ugly,
it's still royal treasure, I guess.

10:05.750 --> 10:08.500
This is the perfect place for us to hide.

10:09.340 --> 10:12.010
But how do we get out of here?

10:13.550 --> 10:16.300
Still no word on the whereabouts
of Flio and the others?

10:16.300 --> 10:19.010
My apologies.

10:19.010 --> 10:23.230
I've mobilized an intel unit
to search them everywhere.

10:23.890 --> 10:27.650
They may have left the kingdom.

10:27.650 --> 10:28.110
No.

10:28.520 --> 10:31.490
No matter how powerful Flio's magic is,

10:31.490 --> 10:35.410
Teleportation can only go to
the place that he already visited.

10:36.160 --> 10:39.450
He was just summoned into this world,

10:39.450 --> 10:42.080
so he shouldn't be
outside of this kingdom.

10:42.500 --> 10:44.160
B-But...

10:44.530 --> 10:46.880
With all due respect,
I think it would be unwise

10:46.880 --> 10:53.630
to stop the invasion and give priority
to searching for that man.

10:54.680 --> 10:57.260
Even though Purification is in effect,

10:57.260 --> 11:01.680
if we let the magic beasts lead,
we can spread malicium through the soil,

11:01.680 --> 11:04.600
creating a path for
our forces to advance.

11:05.030 --> 11:10.190
If we take this opportunity to strike in
full force, we can take down the castle.

11:10.550 --> 11:13.940
If the Klyrode's Castle falls,
our wish will be—

11:17.830 --> 11:19.240
Have you forgotten?

11:19.680 --> 11:23.750
That man can use Purification by himself.

11:25.250 --> 11:32.590
Flio can purify the path that's created by
sacrificing magic beasts if he wants.

11:32.590 --> 11:36.050
Searching for them is our priority!

11:36.050 --> 11:42.600
If we do that, we won't be able to suppress
those who doubt you anymore!

11:56.110 --> 11:59.200
I've caused you trouble, Uliminas.

11:59.660 --> 12:03.620
But I can't bend my own principles.

12:03.620 --> 12:10.130
I don't feel that it's worth to win
by sacrificing our people.

12:10.790 --> 12:12.840
Dark One...

12:25.770 --> 12:28.350
My brother is going soft? How?!

12:28.710 --> 12:31.860
Please lower your voice, Lord Yuigarde.

12:31.860 --> 12:37.030
Uliminas controls the intel,
so we never know if they are nearby or not.

12:37.030 --> 12:39.610
I don't care about that!

12:41.530 --> 12:44.870
Rather than continue the invasion,

12:44.870 --> 12:49.710
he's trying to recruit a human
into the Dark Army?

12:49.710 --> 12:51.000
It doesn't make sense.

12:51.000 --> 12:56.960
It seems that human possesses
the power of a hero, so Lord Ghol—

12:56.960 --> 12:59.680
That's called being soft!

13:01.220 --> 13:05.140
Hero or not, humans must be crushed!

13:05.140 --> 13:08.310
Why does he waste time
playing friends with him?!

13:09.850 --> 13:13.480
Crushing the enemy with full force,
that's what the Dark One would do.

13:13.480 --> 13:14.860
Am I right?!

13:17.820 --> 13:22.030
Everything you said is right,
Lord Yuigarde.

13:22.320 --> 13:25.120
Since it comes to this,

13:25.620 --> 13:28.700
I'm gonna seize the throne
from my brother.

13:28.700 --> 13:33.330
Then I'll destroy Klyrode
as the new Dark One!

13:34.040 --> 13:37.340
From now on, this is my era!

13:40.630 --> 13:43.970
All right, I think we've got
everything we need.

13:44.430 --> 13:47.810
We even found some ingredients
from beyond this kingdom.

13:47.810 --> 13:49.770
I can't wait to try cooking them.

13:50.270 --> 13:53.100
I'm still worried about
the reaction to the barrier,

13:53.730 --> 13:56.690
but it seems nothing is happening.

13:57.880 --> 14:00.110
We still have time before
we meet up with everyone.

14:00.510 --> 14:02.320
How about having a lunch?

14:03.570 --> 14:04.780
Then...

14:04.780 --> 14:09.040
There's a new place on the corner
of Sukana Street.

14:09.040 --> 14:12.290
I heard that we can have
delicious saltwater fish.

14:12.290 --> 14:14.630
I think I know that place.

14:14.630 --> 14:18.210
Since Klyrode is mostly
surrounded by mountains,

14:18.210 --> 14:22.220
setting up trade routes
must be really hard.

14:23.840 --> 14:24.840
Huh?

14:25.300 --> 14:27.510
What happened to the sign
on Haldi's shop?

14:28.600 --> 14:29.850
Mrs. Haldi!

14:29.850 --> 14:31.980
If it isn't Flio and Rys.

14:31.980 --> 14:34.100
Are you closing your shop?

14:34.100 --> 14:34.810
Yes.

14:34.810 --> 14:39.020
I've run this shop for years,
so it's kind of sad.

14:39.020 --> 14:43.700
But at my age, it's tough
to search for new suppliers.

14:43.700 --> 14:45.410
I'm out of options.

14:45.410 --> 14:46.740
New suppliers?

14:46.740 --> 14:49.490
What happened to your usual vendors?

14:49.490 --> 14:52.870
It was during the last war
against the Dark Army,

14:52.870 --> 14:58.270
that the area of my preferred
workshop was destroyed.

14:58.990 --> 15:02.300
What's more, the trade routes for
our products are now ruined.

15:03.170 --> 15:05.870
I think it's time for me to retire.

15:12.930 --> 15:18.270
Even though it is far from the warzone,
the effect can still reach this town.

15:18.270 --> 15:19.520
Yeah.

15:20.070 --> 15:25.700
But on the other side,
new shops are opening too.

15:25.700 --> 15:28.450
Humans are quite resilient.

15:28.910 --> 15:31.080
Let's have a lunch.

15:31.080 --> 15:32.230
Yes.

15:33.580 --> 15:35.790
Sir Flio! Lady Rys!

15:36.330 --> 15:37.540
Balirossa.

15:37.540 --> 15:40.170
Are you two about to have lunch?

15:40.170 --> 15:41.840
That's right.

15:41.840 --> 15:45.260
Please allow me to treat you.

15:45.260 --> 15:48.470
I was about to have lunch
together with my dear...

15:48.970 --> 15:52.060
Um, if it's not a bother...

15:52.060 --> 15:53.770
I don't mind it.

15:53.770 --> 15:54.980
Isn't that right, Rys?

15:54.980 --> 15:56.690
Right...

15:56.690 --> 16:01.690
Ahem. And what's with the occasion?
Treating us all of a sudden.

16:02.090 --> 16:06.780
Actually, my adventurer rank has gone up,
and my rewards have also increased.

16:07.190 --> 16:09.320
Congratulations, Balirossa!

16:09.320 --> 16:12.240
You've been working really hard lately.

16:12.690 --> 16:16.580
Well, I worked hard to shake
those nightmares.

16:17.080 --> 16:22.170
But thanks to both of your guidance,
I was able to earn such a reward.

16:22.170 --> 16:25.920
It might be trivial, but let me repay,
like buying you lunch.

16:26.470 --> 16:28.930
What do you say?
Should we?

16:28.930 --> 16:30.840
Well, we can't say no to that.

16:30.840 --> 16:32.470
Exalted One!

16:33.100 --> 16:34.430
Hiya?

16:34.850 --> 16:38.020
A demon with incredible magic
is approaching!

16:38.390 --> 16:39.730
Stand back, please!

16:40.270 --> 16:42.110
In this town again?!

16:42.940 --> 16:45.150
Hiya, hold on!

16:47.650 --> 16:50.570
I wonder who triggered the reaction,

16:51.160 --> 16:52.490
so it was you, Ghozal.

16:52.490 --> 16:55.330
If it isn't Flio.

16:58.690 --> 17:00.920
It's been a while.

17:00.920 --> 17:06.880
My intel reported a strange barrier here,
so I came by to see for myself.

17:07.220 --> 17:08.920
I'm happy to see you again.

17:08.920 --> 17:10.590
I'm glad to see you doing well.

17:11.220 --> 17:12.800
Balirossa.

17:13.210 --> 17:16.770
I'd love to have a chat with you.

17:16.770 --> 17:21.480
So the dreams I had
were a premonition?

17:21.480 --> 17:23.190
Thanks for waiting.

17:23.590 --> 17:26.930
The human food is really
glamorous and delicious.

17:26.930 --> 17:28.360
Before I took the throne,

17:28.360 --> 17:32.160
I used to come to places like this
to gather intel on the enemy.

17:32.160 --> 17:33.660
Is that so?

17:33.660 --> 17:36.200
Demons have restaurants, too.

17:36.200 --> 17:39.000
But there's almost nothing
that I'd call cooking.

17:39.490 --> 17:41.710
I can guess what that's like.

17:42.000 --> 17:44.130
This is so delicious, you know!

17:45.710 --> 17:50.050
Let's make sure no one else can listen
to our conversations.

17:50.630 --> 17:53.220
Do you cook, Balirossa?

17:53.220 --> 17:56.220
Balirossa is good at making pastries.

17:56.220 --> 17:56.890
Wow.

17:56.890 --> 18:00.020
I tried to make some after she taught me.

18:00.020 --> 18:04.270
But it's very difficult to make some
that require details on its ingredients.

18:04.270 --> 18:05.940
I see.

18:06.360 --> 18:10.280
You're really interested
in human culture, huh?

18:10.900 --> 18:15.240
Cultural prosperity and military power
are proportional to each other.

18:16.030 --> 18:20.040
Then, are you gathering intel
on the enemy even now?

18:20.040 --> 18:24.460
You could say so
since I still hope to win Flio over.

18:28.300 --> 18:35.220
You've come to know our lives,
so you can trample them?

18:37.140 --> 18:38.180
That's right.

18:38.180 --> 18:39.350
How dare you!

18:39.350 --> 18:40.620
Balirossa!

18:41.170 --> 18:43.820
The same goes for you humans.

18:44.770 --> 18:49.520
To you humans,
our existence is a threat.

18:49.520 --> 18:53.070
And there's no way we could
accept that oppression.

18:55.280 --> 19:00.120
We've been living with Rys for a while,
and nothing bad has happened to us.

19:00.830 --> 19:01.870
What threat?

19:01.870 --> 19:04.500
You don't know, huh?

19:04.500 --> 19:09.630
The big difference between humans
and demons is the malicium.

19:10.070 --> 19:17.010
Demons and magic beasts can control it,
while some can't.

19:17.720 --> 19:22.090
The latter is constantly leaking
small amounts of malicium.

19:23.430 --> 19:28.940
If they gather in one place, it will pollute
the area and also be harmful to humans.

19:29.300 --> 19:32.650
So that's what happened
to the Delaveza Forest.

19:32.650 --> 19:37.610
Sybe and the horse-type magic beasts
can control their malicium.

19:37.610 --> 19:40.160
There's no need to worry, my dear.

19:40.160 --> 19:42.910
I don't, but...

19:43.540 --> 19:46.540
This conflict runs much deeper
than I expected.

19:46.540 --> 19:47.460
Right.

19:47.460 --> 19:50.130
In addition, the demons are
also very meritocratic.

19:50.130 --> 19:52.460
Many of them are bloodthirsty.

19:52.460 --> 19:55.090
They're very eager to get into a fight.

19:55.090 --> 19:57.470
What are you looking at me for?

19:57.470 --> 19:59.850
I'm sorry I've put a damper
on the mood.

19:59.850 --> 20:02.210
You can have fun without me.

20:05.180 --> 20:06.560
Let's meet again.

20:15.150 --> 20:21.200
I was relieved when I found out demihumans
aren't discriminated against in this world.

20:24.540 --> 20:26.330
Ah, there they are.

20:26.330 --> 20:29.290
We're done shopping, Sir Flio!

20:30.920 --> 20:33.340
What happened, Balirossa?

20:34.380 --> 20:35.710
It's nothing.

20:45.890 --> 20:47.930
The demons and the humans...

20:47.930 --> 20:54.020
The wall between them might be
thicker than in my old world.

20:55.730 --> 20:57.240
My dear?

21:01.030 --> 21:03.330
My dear?!

21:03.330 --> 21:07.000
I'm happy, but why so sudden?

21:08.580 --> 21:10.520
Just a moment...

21:18.800 --> 21:19.740
Yes.

21:34.110 --> 21:38.940
My hands hurt!
I can't climb anymore, Sir Hero!

21:38.940 --> 21:44.030
Endure it a bit more!
We're almost out!

21:44.030 --> 21:47.240
Yes, Sir Hero!

21:49.040 --> 21:51.210
Heave-ho...

21:56.670 --> 21:58.420
Tsuya, what are you doing—

23:40.980 --> 23:43.690
What does Lord Gholl like about you?

23:43.690 --> 23:45.030
Huh?!

23:45.030 --> 23:48.700
What's so good about a kind
and caring woman like you?

23:48.700 --> 23:50.240
Is that a compliment?

23:50.240 --> 23:53.120
Humans and demons have
different criteria to be popular.

23:53.120 --> 23:56.080
Vicious and ferocious are
the condition of a good woman!

23:56.080 --> 23:56.620
Demons' criteria are so scary.

23:56.620 --> 23:59.290
NEXT EPISODE: A WOLF AND AN ADVENTURER
Demons' criteria are so scary.
